A deterministic (seeded), in-memory BrokerGateway with no network
dependency at all — implemented first, per the milestone instruction,
so every future Quant Core module can be developed and tested without
a live broker connection.

Generates a seeded random-walk price series for candles/ticks and
fills every submitted order immediately. Not a realistic market
simulator (no volatility regimes, no microstructure) — it's a working
connect/data/order/position lifecycle to build and test against, not
a backtesting engine.

config.settings.broker now defaults to 'simulation', so the platform
runs out of the box with zero credentials.

24 tests covering connection lifecycle, account info, candle
generation (including determinism for a given seed), tick streaming,
and order submission.
